rest. Up to 24 Months.<\/strong><\/h2>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"richtext_iAa47t":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<p>Your backyard transformation starts today. A-DIY's flexible financing makes it easy to get your deck now and spread the cost into payments that work for your life.<\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>$0 down to get started<\/li><li>0% interest financing available<\/li><li>Flexible terms up to 24 months<\/li><li>Transparent monthly payments<\/li><li>Fast application <\/li><\/ul>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-12","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-6"}}},"block_order":["image_YRDwfz","richtext_mTKVXg","richtext_iAa47t"],"name":"Media With Text","settings":{"media_position":"left","media_position_mobile":"top","background_color":"#f6f4f2","section_id":"","vertical_padding_section":"48px  | 48px","container_spacing":"px-container-md","responsive_visibility":""}},"media_with_text_TpiXUY":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_iK3MDJ":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/build-the-backyard-youve-been-picturing.png"}},"richtext_8Gc3h8":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"","richtext_class":"text-16\/14-500","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"richtext_bbKDAQ":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<h2><strong>Build the Backyard You've Been Picturing. This Weekend.<\/strong><\/h2>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"richtext_gPnCVe":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<p>A-DIY ships everything you need, straight to your door. You choose the size, pick your material, and build the outdoor space your family will love.<\/p>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-6","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-2"}},"buttons_jtrXy3":{"type":"buttons","settings":{"button_primary_text":"Shop Backyard Deck Kits","button_primary_url":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/shop\/","button_primary_class":"button-primary","button_secondary_text":"See How It Works","button_secondary_url":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/pages\/why-a-diy-1","button_secondary_class":"button-secondary"}}},"block_order":["image_iK3MDJ","richtext_8Gc3h8","richtext_bbKDAQ","richtext_gPnCVe","buttons_jtrXy3"],"name":"Media With Text","settings":{"media_position":"right","media_position_mobile":"top","background_color":"#ffffff","section_id":"","vertical_padding_section":"32px\/24px | 48px","container_spacing":"px-container-md","responsive_visibility":""}},"preset_faq_CwTqgX":{"type":"preset__faq","blocks":{"richtext_zEPG48":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"title":"<h2><strong>Everything You Want to Know About A-DIY Backyard Decks.<\/strong><\/h2>","page_content":"","use_page_content":false,"content_class":"richtext-md","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 40px\/32px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | center","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":"","color_override":""}},"collapsible_bwtd3k":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What sizes are available, and can I customize?<\/strong>","content":"<p>A-DIY deck kits range from 12'x12' (144 sq ft) to 16'x28' (448 sq ft). Our modular system is designed to connect seamlessly, so you can combine kits to create larger decks, L-shapes, and completely custom configurations for any backyard layout. <\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_FhpDi8":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Which material should I choose, pressure-treated or composite?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Both deliver the same professional-grade structural foundation. The difference is in the deck surface. Pressure-treated gives you a classic natural wood look, while composite gives you a fade-resistant, splinter-free surface.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_Ji9w8f":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Do I need any prior building experience?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Not at all. A-DIY kits are designed for homeowners of all experience levels. Every component arrives pre-cut and precision-engineered to fit together perfectly. Our step-by-step 3D assembly app guides you through the entire process. All you need is a standard power drill.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_xRCEmR":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>How long does assembly really take?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Most homeowners have their deck fully assembled in under an hour. Larger configurations or multi-kit builds take a little longer, but the process is consistent throughout. Many customers are sitting on their new deck the same day their kit arrives.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_HrYWCC":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Can my deck be elevated, or is it ground-level only?<\/strong>","content":"<p>A-DIY decks work beautifully at ground level and can also be elevated up to 43 inches (approximately 3–4 steps) using extended post kits. For higher elevations, we recommend consulting a local structural professional for site-specific support requirements.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_JzMhTQ":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Can the deck be moved or reinstalled in a new location?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Yes. A-DIY deck kits are designed to be disassembled and reinstalled, making them a flexible option for homeowners who may relocate, renters with landlord approval, or anyone who wants a semi-permanent outdoor solution they can take with them.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_eGzRUC":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What is TuffBlock, and why don't I need concrete?<\/strong>","content":"<p>TuffBlock is a high-strength deck foundation block included with every kit. Instead of digging footings and pouring concrete, TuffBlock supports your deck from the ground up to simplify installation while meeting load requirements for a ground-level or slightly elevated deck. <\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905p